      "question": "How do I become a landlord for the first time?",
      "answer": "Start by confirming your mortgage terms and converting your insurance to a landlord policy. Inspect safety alarms, satisfy federal lead disclosures for pre-1978 homes, and establish written screening criteria before marketing your rental."
